Description: Browser web apps get their own taskbar button
 A window is grouped by its first class id; Brave/Chromium web-app windows
 are class "Brave-browser" with the instance name "crx_<app id>", so every
 installed web app joined the browser's button. Now a window whose other
 class id (the X11 instance name) is exactly an installed launcher's
 StartupWMClass goes to that launcher: each web app gets its own button, icon
 and name (and joins its pin). Normal browser windows, whose instance name is
 the browser's own StartupWMClass, stay with the browser.
Author: KiteOS <6760806+iwankurnia@users.noreply.github.com>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-26
